      "value": "Ritual of Sanctum Invocation"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This ritual designates a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Place of Power",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " for your faction. \n\nUpon completion, it spawns a single block, a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Loci of Power",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "'. \n\nActivating this block will cause me to be granted a vision of a structure that I will then need to build. \n\nUpon completion, the Circle of Power will activate. Allied faction wizards (and me of course) when standing near or within the completed structure will gain a powerful buff to their spell casting, causing more damage with spells and making their buffs last significantly longer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "For the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Undead",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": ", this sanctum serves an additional purpose. Enemies within the sanctum will be given the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Vulnerable Soul",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " debuff. Killing enemies with this debuff will yield significantly more souls than normal."
        }
      ]
    }
